=== stranger_1 ===
Hello *player*. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
How's the adjustment period going? #emotion: neutral
-> END

=== stranger_2 ===
Hey *player*. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
This settlement is pretty impressive and well run. #emotion: happy
Mayor Johnson seems to be quite knowledgable. #emotion: happy
->END

=== stranger_3 ===
I hope our arrival didn't disturb the settlement too much. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
I'm sure it's just as shocking to them as it was to us. #emotion:neutral
Let's hope we can settle into the routine of the settlement and live in harmony. #emotion:happy
->END

=== stranger_4 ===
It's surreal that only three of the five ships made it to Raea. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
I hope the other two ships show up one day. #emotion:neutral
->END

=== acquaintance_1 ===
Hey *player*! #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
How's the farm coming along?  #emotion:neutral
The settlement appreciates your hard work. #emotion:happy
->END

=== acquaintance_2 ===
Have you visited the library yet? #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
It's quite expansive for this settlement. #emotion:happy
I always head there when I need a break. #emotion:xd
->END

=== acquaintance_3 ===
Can you imagine what the settlement would've looked like if all five ships made it on time? #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
We'd be looking like a major city! #emotion:xd
Minus the high crime rate hopefully. #emotion:neutral
->END

=== acquaintance_4 ===
Working at the Town Hall hasn't been too bad. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
Haven't spoken to Mayor Johnson much. #emotion:neutral
But I'm sure he's busy, being the mayor and all. #emotion:happy
->END

=== friend_1 ===
At some point, we will have to consider expanding the settlement. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
We are already low on housing. #emotion:neutral
We need to ensure that the settlement is ready to support the next generation. #emotion:happy
Haven't been able to speak to Mayor Johnson about it though... #emotion:neutral
->END

=== friend_2 ===
Hey *player* good to see you! #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
You are looking well. #emotion:xd
Make sure to keep your diet clean. #emotion:happy
It will keep you productive! #emotion:xd
->END

=== friend_3 ===
How's the fishing on Raea? #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
I haven't been able to go due to my inconsistent work schedule. #emotion:neutral
Matt and I would always go on fishing trips when we were free. #emotion:happy
It was fun, but only if we caught something. #emotion:xd
->END

=== friend_4 ===
You know, Eugene is a very smart guy. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
His logistic skills are awesome. #emotion:happy
If he had more confidence, he's got a bright future in public service. #emotion:happy
->END

=== goodfriend_1 ===
Visited our dear friend Charlotte today. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
It's sometimes hard to grasp that we were supposed to be that old by now. #emotion:neutral
We were a lifetime late... #emotion:neutral
Does that bother you ever? #emotion:neutral
->END

=== goodfriend_2 ===
I struggle to understand why we aren't allowed outside the dome. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:annoyed
Is there something that dangerous out there? #emotion:neutral
People have the right to explore the planet. #emotion:happy
->END

=== goodfriend_3 ===
Hey *player* I just wanted to say thank you. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
You're not only a fantastic farmer, but a great friend as well. #emotion:xd
Keep being you. #emotion:happy
->END

=== goodfriend_4 ===
You want to know something about Jet? #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
He may be annoying, inappropriate, and never takes anything serious. #emotion:neutral
And his farts man... oh my lord... SOUR! #emotion:annoyed
But, he is always such a positive force in the settlement. #emotion:happy
Always makes me chuckle on my worst days. #emotion:happy
We all need a friend like Jet sometimes. #emotion:xd
->END

=== bestfriend_1 ===
Living here on Raea can get somber at times without Matt. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:neutral
But having friends like you make the greiving process easier to stomach. #emotion:happy
Thank you *player* for being there. #emotion:xd
Let's keep giving it our best! #emotion:happy
For Raea and for humanity. #emotion:happy
->END

=== bestfriend_2 ===
I have to be honest *player*, Arno just really pisses me off. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:annoyed
All he does is complain man. #emotion:annoyed
Like be the source of change rather than just sitting around complaining. #emotion:annoyed
Sorry... #emotion:neutral
He just really bothers me sometimes. #emotion:neutral
