=== bestfriend_4 ===
I've been a lot more persistant when talking ideas and policy with Mayor Johnson. #speaker:Lucas #emotion:happy
He seems annoyed by this trend, but I don't care. #emotion:xd
I'm done trying to not step on anyone's toes. #emotion:neutral
In fact, I'll wear cleats and stomp on your dawgs if it's for the good of the people. #emotion:xd
Boom! #emotion:happy
->END

=== two_hearts_scene ===
Hey *player* good to see you! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Hey Lucas. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Can you believe we made it to Raea? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
I mean despite arriving here so late, we still made it. #emotion: happy
I can't help but wonder how our ship made it despite its malfunctions. #emotion: neutral
We could've been still be floating in space. #emotion: neutral
Destined for death. #emotion: neutral
Woah... #emotion: neutral
Didn't mean for that to turn so dark... #emotion: neutral
But destiny had a different plan eh? #emotion: happy
Still... #emotion: neutral
I wonder how much we missed. #emotion: neutral
I mean, it has been 80 years right? #emotion: happy
Wonder how much different Raea would be if we were a part of the Originals. #emotion: neutral
I bet the settlement would've been even better! #emotion: happy
I mean, you've already settled into your job so well! #emotion: happy
Instant impact I would say! #emotion: happy
Nikki has also had a solid start at the Blacksmith. #emotion: happy
And Jet well... #emotion: neutral
He's trying his best! #emotion: happy
I have no doubt that we would've been crucial pieces for the settlement 80 years ago. #emotion: happy
But we have to focus on the present! #emotion: happy
Continue to pursue greatness! #emotion: happy
Sorry I'm rambling haha! #emotion: happy
I'll let you get back to it. #emotion: happy
Pleasure to talk to you *player*! #emotion: happy
->END

=== four_hearts_scene ===
C'mon Eugene push yourself! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Why- are- we- doing- this- #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
It's important to stay in tip top physical shape. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Great physical fitness means higher efficiency in the workplace! #emotion: neutral
Alright now for some jumping jacks! #emotion: happy
1... 2.. 3... #emotion: neutral
My glasses are fogged over I can't see anything! #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Obstacles just make you stronger Eugene! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
All I see is cloudiness! #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
And cloudiness means uncertainty of what's ahead! #emotion: neutral
And that means-! #emotion: neutral
Greatness! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Anxiety! #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Alright I think we can take a break! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Whew don't you feel refreshed Eugene? #emotion: happy
I feel nauseuos. #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Ah that'll go away in no time flat! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Sleepy time- #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Oh crap he passed out! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Hey *player* help me get him inside! #emotion: neutral
Quickly! #emotion: neutral
//Scene swtiches to inside Town Hall
Excuse me miss can you get Eugene some water and a wet towel? #emotion: neutral
Y-yes. #speaker: Ayla #emotion: neutral
//scene switches to later
I pushed him too hard. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
I should've known better. #emotion: neutral
Thank you for getting the water and towel so quickly. #emotion: happy
Mind if I get your name? #emotion: happy
A-Ayla. #speaker: Ayla #emotion: neutral
Thank you Ayla for your help. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
I'm Lucas by the way.  #emotion: happy
I've seen you at the library everyday but never had the time to introduce myself. #emotion: happy
What a time for an introduction eh? #emotion: happy
Not a great first impression on my part. #emotion: neutral
So this is what the after life is? #speaker: Eugene #emotion: happy
A continuation of the war path I was just in? #emotion: happy
Disappointing... #emotion: neutral
Eugene you're awake! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
I'm so relieved! #emotion: happy
Here drink this it will hydrate you! #emotion: neutral
A soul in the afterlife does not need hydration. #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Just a place to call home. #emotion: neutral
What? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
No Eugene you're not dead! #emotion: happy
You just fainted from over exerting yourself. #emotion: neutral
Is that so? #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
Then I shall hydrate. #emotion: happy
I'm sorry about pushing you so hard Eugene. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
I should've known we were at different physical capabilities. #emotion: neutral
That's alright my young pupil. #speaker: Eugene #emotion: neutral
You shall redeem yourself in sorcery training at dawn. #emotion: neutral
We're gonna need more water. #emotion: neutral
->END

=== six_hearts_scene ===
So you're the famous grandson of Lubanzi! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
I knew Lubanzi personally, he was a great man. #emotion: happy
Yeah dude awesome you can just call me Arno. #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
Good to meet you Arno! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
What brings you to the Town Hall? #emotion: neutral
Well usually I'd never set foot in this dump, #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
But I was curious if there's any tunes I could learn. #emotion: happy
Well I'm sure there are some songs. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Meh usually this place is a little... #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
Outdated... #emotion: neutral
Not a big fan of the Town Hall? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Not a big fan of how this place is run. #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
Huh? Why not? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Well you dudes just don't do much. #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
Stuck in ya old ways. #emotion: neutral
That's not true. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
We help better the peoples lives, striving for- #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Listen brotha I really don't want to hear your rah rah speech. #speaker: Arno #emotion: happy
You guys could care less about what's best for the people. #emotion: neutral
It's all about power. #emotion: neutral
Although I do appreciate the hype you have. #emotion: happy
Means you don't got power yet. #emotion: neutral
Now if you could excuse me- #emotion: happy
It's not all about power to me. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
I want to help people live better lives here! #emotion: happy
I'm sure ya do my guy. #speaker: Arno #emotion: happy 
Your grandpa and Matthew would say the same thing! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Hmm I'm sure they said that. #speaker: Arno #emotion: neutral
But I don't think you really knew Atkins or my Pop. #emotion: neutral
But keep doing you brotha! #emotion: happy
Peace! #emotion: happy
Oh whaddup *player*! #emotion: happy
Looking clean as always! #emotion: happy
//Arno leaves
Dang he's really different than Lubanzi isn't he *player*. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
He really doesn't like how things are run here. #emotion: neutral
What do you think *player*? #emotion: neutral

* Things are being run really well
I think things are being run well here! #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Yeah I agree with you! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
But it still makes me wonder what isn't working well for him. #emotion: neutral
That way we can fix it! #emotion: happy
->DONE
* I'm not sure
I'm really not sure. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
That's an understandable answer. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
It's always really difficult to distinguish between emotional and constructive feedback. #emotion: neutral
->DONE
* This government is a mess!
This government is a mess! #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
You think so as well? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
Well if you and Lubanzi's grandson say that it's a mess then it really is! #emotion: neutral
I will meet with Mayor Johnson to address these issues! #emotion: neutral
->DONE
Thanks for your feedback *player*! #emotion: happy
->END

=== eight_hearts_scene ===
Hey *player* it's a wonderful day outside isn't it? #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Yeah it is. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
It's always important to get vitamin D to keep sharp mentally. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Not like I need to be mentally sharp filing paperwork over and over again. #emotion: neutral
... #emotion: neutral
I've been thinking a lot about that encounter with Arno a while back. #emotion: neutral
When he said people in politics don't want to better people's lives they just want power. #emotion: neutral
At first I was in full denial about that statement. #emotion: neutral
But after working in the Town Hall for awhile now, #emotion: neutral
There seems to be no urgency whatsoever to help better peoples lives. #emotion: neutral
I mean I've literally been just filing documents since the arrivals. #emotion: neutral
On top of that, I hardly see Mayor Johnson. #emotion: neutral
I think I can count on one hand the number of interactions with him. #emotion: neutral
All this just makes me think that politics is all about power here on Raea. #emotion: neutral
Just like earth. #emotion: neutral
That terrifies me *player*.  #emotion: neutral
Because what if I get the opportunity to hold a higher office in the future? #emotion: neutral
What if I become a power hungry tyrant and lose my way? #emotion: neutral
I don't think I could live with myself. #emotion: neutral
Sometimes I just wish that our ship arrived on time. #emotion: neutral
I know that's selfish of me to say. #emotion: neutral
But I was supposed to build the foundation with Matthew here on Raea. #emotion: neutral
Build a new world with my best friend. #emotion: neutral
Do it differently than on earth. #emotion: neutral
A chance for a do over. #emotion: neutral
Now he's gone and I'm here just filing papers. #emotion: neutral
I miss him dearly. #emotion: neutral
It sucks *player*. #emotion: neutral
It's confusing. #emotion: neutral
Agh sorry for ranting. #emotion: neutral
I'm sure the last thing you need to hear is me complain. #emotion: neutral
That's ok Lucas I'm here for you. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
I know you are *player* and I really appreciate you. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
You're a special person and don't let anyone tell you otherwise. #emotion: happy
I better get back to the Town Hall. #emotion: neutral
->END

=== ten_hearts_scene ===
Hey *player* it's so great to see you! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
Hey Lucas you seem in high spirits. #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Yes haha I am in way higher spirits than last time we talked here! #speaker: Lucas #emotion: happy
I want to thank you again for listening to that rant of mine. #emotion: happy
I think it was building up and I needed to get it off my chest. #emotion: happy
And I've come a realization as well! #emotion: happy
What would that be? #speaker: *player* #emotion: none
Well before we all left for the expedition for Raea, Matthew and I hung out one last time. #speaker: Lucas #emotion: neutral
We were talking about our excitements and fear. #emotion: happy
I told Matthew about the same thing we talked about where I feared about politics being the same on Raea than earth. #emotion: neutral
He had a unbelievably simple response. #emotion: neutral
He told me that only worry about things that you can control. #emotion: neutral
Super simple right? #emotion: happy
Matthew always said the most simple answers to the most complicated questions. #emotion: neutral
But he's right! #emotion: happy
I was letting the fear of aspects I can't control plague my mind. #emotion: neutral
The path of how the government got here on Raea is something I simply can't control. #emotion: neutral
The fact that our ship arrived 80 years late is something I can't control. #emotion: neutral
The only thing I can control is how I react to the world around me. #emotion: happy
I could be discouraged like I was the other day and afraid. #emotion: neutral
Or I can double down on my dream to make people's lives better each and everyday. #emotion: happy
And I don't need a title in order to be impactful! #emotion: happy
I can help the community each and everyday by helping others around me. #emotion: happy
Just like what you do *player*! #emotion: happy
You are so kind to the community. #emotion: happy
You listen to people like me who needs someone to rant their problems to! #emotion: happy
You're a saint! #emotion: happy
That's why I'm so lucky you are my friend here on Raea. #emotion: happy
My best friend if I'm being honest!  #emotion: happy
Because you are my best friend I'd like to give you a gift! #emotion: happy
As you may know, I really enjoy fish cuisine. #emotion: happy
So I made you some fish fillet. #emotion: happy
I was thinking since you work so hard each and everyday. #emotion: happy
This would provide you a boost!  #emotion: happy
I hope you like it! #emotion: happy
And I want to reiterate again that you are the best! #emotion: happy
Thank you for everything *player*! #emotion: happy
->END

